{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 55047,
	"Name": "AT Sugarspell Machine Themes",
	"Author": "AlchemistYeoni",
	"Description": "[heading]English[/heading]\n<br />A collection of [b]Alternative Textures themes[/b] for the crafting machines in Alchemist Yeoni’s Sugarspell Shop. Choose a theme from the [b]Files[/b] tab and give your workshop a look of its own.\n<br />\n<br />[*]Installation\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]Install Alchemist Yeoni’s Sugarspell Shop, Alternative Textures 8.1.1 or later, and Sugarspell AT Framework 1.3.5 or later.[/*]\n<br />[*]Download a theme from the [b]Files[/b] tab, extract it, and place the theme folder [b]alongside the [/b]\n<br />[code]Sugarspell AT Framework[/code][b]folder[/b].[/*]\n<br />[*]Use the Alternative Textures [b]Paint Bucket[/b] on a machine to select its appearance.[/*]\n<br />[/list]Special thanks to\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/54637962]JerryBBS2[/url],\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/210387900]BogWyytch[/url]\u00A0for kindly allowing me to use their assets from the AT (Alternative Textures) mod.\n<br />[line]\n<br />[color=#fafafa][size=4]한국어[/size][/color]\n<br />알케미스트 연이의 슈가스펠 샵 제작 기계에 적용할 수 있는 [b]Alternative Textures 테마 모음[/b]입니다. [b]Files[/b] 탭에서 원하는 테마를 골라 나만의 마녀 작업실을 꾸며 보세요.\n<br />\n<br />설치 및 사용\n<br />[list=1]\n<br />[*]알케미스트 연이의 슈가스펠 샵, Alternative Textures 8.1.1 이상, Sugarspell AT Framework 1.3.5 이상을 설치해 주세요.[/*]\n<br />[*][b]Files[/b] 탭에서 원하는 테마를 다운로드해 압축을 풀고,\n<br />[code]Sugarspell AT Framework[/code][b]폴더가 있는 위치에 테마 폴더를 나란히[/b] 넣어 주세요.[/*]\n<br />[*]게임에서 Alternative Textures의 [b]페인트 통[/b]을 기계에 사용해 원하는 외형을 선택하세요.\n<br />\n<br />\uD83D\uDC96 크레딧 및 감사 인사 (Special Thanks)[/*]\n<br />[/list]Special thanks to\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/54637962]JerryBBS2[/url],\u00A0[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/210387900]BogWyytch[/url]\u00A0for kindly allowing me to use their assets from the AT (Alternative Textures) mod.\n<br />[b]AT(Alternative Textures) 모드에 에셋을 사용할 수 있도록 허락해주신\u00A0[/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/54637962][b]JerryBBS2[/b][/url][b] 님과 \u00A0 [/b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/210387900][b]BogWytch[/b][/url][b] 님께 진심으로 감사드립니다.\u00A0[/b]\n<br />\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - BOG Machines ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/210387900]BogWytch[/url])\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Gothic Purple Witch\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Gothic Red Witch\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Moonlit Greenhouse\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Strawberry Cake\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Red Velvet Friends\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Rococo Princess\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Ribbon Frill and Lace\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Magical Girl\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Mint Chocolate\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Opal Glass\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Chocolate Cake\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Pudding Jelly\u00A0\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Pink Rose ([url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/users/54637962]JerryBBS2[/url])\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Hai and Hayang\n<br />[AT] Sugarspell - Halloween\n<br />\n<br />[img]https://staticdelivery.nexusmods.com/mods/1303/images/55047/55047-1793830905-1872567868.png[/img] [/*]\n<br />",
